    "long_instructions": "## **Add Priority Task**\r\n\r\nWhen the user clicks **Add Priority Task**, the new task should be added to the **beginning** of the list.\r\n\r\n#### **Do This:**\r\n\r\n1. Use AI to help you write a function called `addPriorityTask`.\r\n\r\n2. In the function, use `.unshift()` to:\r\n    - add the title to `titleArray`\r\n    - add the details to `detailArray`\r\n    - add `true` to `isPriorityArray`\r\n\r\n3. Call `renderTasks()` as the last line of the `addPriorityTask` function.\r\n\r\n4. Use your function as the event handler for the **Add Priority Task** button."
  },
